Surviving parents of gold star veterans-
SF0102
exemptions.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Landen, Anderson, Brennan and Dockstader
and Representative(s) Harshman and Locke
AN ACT relating to taxation and revenue; providing tax exemptions for surviving
parents of veterans as specified; requiring rulemaking; and providing for
effective dates.
